🔗 2. LINKED LIST MASTER TEMPLATE
Node Definition
class ListNode {
    int val;
    ListNode next;
    ListNode(int val) { this.val = val; }
}

Traverse
ListNode curr = head;
while (curr != null) {
    // process curr.val
    curr = curr.next;
}

Reverse Linked List
ListNode prev = null, curr = head;
while (curr != null) {
    ListNode next = curr.next;
    curr.next = prev;
    prev = curr;
    curr = next;
}
return prev;

Detect Cycle (Floyd’s Algorithm)
ListNode slow = head, fast = head;
while (fast != null && fast.next != null) {
    slow = slow.next;
    fast = fast.next.next;
    if (slow == fast) return true;
}
return false;


✅ Used for: Palindrome check, intersection, middle node, etc.

